{"id":"9d0899f41785970a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-bernoulli.md","title":"Bernoulli","display":"df-bernoulli — Bernoulli","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bernoulli","aliases":["58-df-bernoulli"],"display":"df-bernoulli — Bernoulli","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bernoulli"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bernoulli</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bernoulli — Bernoulli"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da478762d021f626\" href=\"?note=da478762d021f626\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md\">../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in V\">\\(B\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da478762d021f626\" href=\"?note=da478762d021f626\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md\">../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BernoulliSeq}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BernoulliSeq}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bernoulli}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BernoulliSeq}_S(B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\\land\n\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bernoulli}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BernoulliSeq}_S(B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\\land\n\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generating-function equation is inherited from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da478762d021f626\" href=\"?note=da478762d021f626\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md\">../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md</a> rather than duplicated under a second incompatible predicate type.</li>\n<li>In coordinate notation, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n=B(n)\">\\(B_n=B(n)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md","status":"resolved","id":"da478762d021f626","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md","status":"resolved","id":"da478762d021f626","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q$ (from [[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md","status":"resolved","id":"da478762d021f626","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The generating-function equation is inherited from [[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md]] rather than duplicated under a second incompatible predicate type.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BernoulliSeq}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bernoulli}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BernoulliSeq}_S(B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\\land\n\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B).","display":true},{"tex":"B_n=B(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":966,"backlinks":[{"id":"01c0000762f5699a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-bernoulli.md|58-df-bernoulli]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["da478762d021f626","d8eb5064b65f8a92"]}